# Type warning: typed variadic declared after untyped rest (slot-ordering violation).
# ...rest must be last; typed variadics must appear before the untyped fallback.
[f: [fn [let ...rest ...ns@Foo] rest]]
=== out
["f": [fn [let rest ns] ...]]

=== warn
typed variadic `...ns` declared after untyped rest parameter — typed variadics must precede the untyped fallback `...rest`
